\newlabel{tab:recommendations}{{162}{238}{Recommended SMART configurations for three mission profiles. Settings map directly to CLI flags in \texttt {passive\_watch.py} (\texttt {-{}-smart-min}, \texttt {-{}-smart-radius}) and \texttt {main.py} (\texttt {-{}-center-verify})}{table.caption.534}{}}
